@inherits LayoutComponentBase

<div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-background text-foreground">
    <main class="flex-1 w-full">
        @(this.Body)
    </main>
</div>

@* 
    Notification Component is registered here to support notifications in the auth layout. 
    As for regular layout we put this inside the header and it is not present here.

    OBS: We could move it to a common place, however using it inside the header bar and not separately 
    is necessary otherwise it would create one extra signalR connection for the notification component 
    (header + notification) in many pages (e.g., Publish Page - 1 signalR connection for the page, 1 
    for header and +1 for notification component), which is not ideal.
*@
<NotificationComponent @rendermode="InteractiveServer"/>